      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h3 id=\"tool-description\"><a href=\"#tool-description\"><strong>Tool Description</strong></a></h3>\n<p>The Contacts list includes a variety of ways in which a user may communicate with other users on the local network or TAK Server. A default communication type (shown in the last column) may be selected and used until another type of communication is selected.</p>\n<h2 id=\"chat\"><a href=\"#chat\">Chat</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2c88eedf741fb4fb.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "width": 102,
      "height": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h3 id=\"tool-description\"><a href=\"#tool-description\"><strong>Tool Description</strong></a></h3>\n<p>The Chat tool logs, organizes and displays the most recent chat message that was sent from each chatroom associated with the local device. This provides a quick resource to see the most current chat activity for all subscribed groups and conversations.</p>\n<h2 id=\"instruction-videos\"><a href=\"#instruction-videos\">Instruction videos</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"contacts-tool-3min\"><a href=\"#contacts-tool-3min\">Contacts Tool (3min)</a></h3>"
